      "file": "claims-private-unchanged.json",
      "description": "Private and public claims (a nested object, an array, null, unicode strings written raw and as \\u escapes including a surrogate pair, and a URI-named claim) are returned unchanged, in the exact payload octets' values (RFC 7519 §4.2-§4.3, ADR 0027 §1)",
